  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When a SteamVR device has a space in its SteamVR serial, the client won't respect the ignore-tracker flag for the device, regardless of quotation marks.\n\nFor example:\n\n--ignore-trackers=\"LHR-XXXXXX\" will ignore the device and won't show in client.\n\n--ignore-trackers=\"Tracker xxxxxxxxxx\" won't ignore the device, and will still show up in the client.\n\nDevices are permitted to have spaces in their names, and does not cause conflicts such as this with other OVR software like Space Calibrator or HaiVR's double waist tracker.",
